{"seq":1,"slug":"wind-animation","title":"风动动画","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-vegetation-rendering/animation/wind-animation","wordCount":1835,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"风动动画\">风动动画</h1><p>一片渲染得再精致的草地，只要它纹丝不动，玩家的余光就会立刻判定「这世界卡住了」。运动是植被和透光并列的两大活力来源之一（见 <a href=\"../foundations/vegetation-components\">植被视觉成分</a>）。但几十万株草不可能各挂一套物理模拟，风动必须做成一段跑在顶点着色器里、几乎零额外成本的确定性动画。这一篇讲清楚为什么风动属于顶点着色器而非物理、如何把风分解成主干-枝条-叶尖三个层级，并给出自 Crysis 沿用至今的分层风模型与数学。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-分层的确定性摆动\">核心概念：分层的确定性摆动</h2><p>真实的风有结构：大尺度的阵风以波的形式扫过整片草甸，单株之内又有主干慢摆、枝条中频晃、叶尖高频颤的层级。风动着色器要复现的就是这两重相干性——空间上波扫过、株内分层级。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[全局风向量&lt;br/&gt;方向 强度 阵风] --&gt; B[主干摆动&lt;br/&gt;低频 大幅]&#10;  A --&gt; C[枝条晃动&lt;br/&gt;中频 中幅]&#10;  A --&gt; D[叶尖颤动&lt;br/&gt;高频 小幅]&#10;  E[顶点属性&lt;br/&gt;高度权重/骨骼段/相位] --&gt; B&#10;  E --&gt; C&#10;  E --&gt; D&#10;  F[per-instance 风相位] --&gt; B&#10;  B --&gt; G[叠加得最终顶点偏移]&#10;  C --&gt; G&#10;  D --&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n  A[全局风向量&lt;br/&gt;方向 强度 阵风] --&gt; B[主干摆动&lt;br/&gt;低频 大幅]\n  A --&gt; C[枝条晃动&lt;br/&gt;中频 中幅]\n  A --&gt; D[叶尖颤动&lt;br/&gt;高频 小幅]\n  E[顶点属性&lt;br/&gt;高度权重/骨骼段/相位] --&gt; B\n  E --&gt; C\n  E --&gt; D\n  F[per-instance 风相位] --&gt; B\n  B --&gt; G[叠加得最终顶点偏移]\n  C --&gt; G\n  D --&gt; G</pre><p>下表把三个层级摊开：每级的频率、振幅、由哪个顶点权重驱动、以及它服务的可信度信号。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>频率</th>\n<th>振幅</th>\n<th>驱动权重</th>\n<th>服务信号</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主干摆动</td>\n<td>低（约 0.1–0.5 Hz）</td>\n<td>大</td>\n<td>到根部高度</td>\n<td>整株的相干摆动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>枝条晃动</td>\n<td>中（约 1–3 Hz）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>枝段/顶点色</td>\n<td>层级丰富度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>叶尖颤动</td>\n<td>高（约 4–10 Hz）</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>叶片边缘遮罩</td>\n<td>细节活力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阵风波</td>\n<td>空间波</td>\n<td>调制以上三者</td>\n<td>世界坐标相位</td>\n<td>波扫过草甸</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"为什么是顶点着色器而不是物理\">为什么是顶点着色器而不是物理</h2><p>有人第一反应是给每株草挂弹簧或布料模拟。这在几十万株的规模上完全不可行：物理要状态（速度、加速度）、要逐帧积分、要防发散，CPU/GPU 都扛不住这个量级，而且物理结果不确定、多机不同步。风动的取巧在于它是确定性的解析动画——顶点偏移只是「时间和位置的函数」，不需要状态、不需要历史、天生可并行、天生跨机一致。</p>\n<p>代价是它不「真」——草不会因为被真正吹弯而积累势能，只是照着正弦规律摆。但对风这种周期性、无需精确因果的运动，解析近似的视觉效果足够好，成本却低几个数量级。真正需要因果和状态的是玩家踩踏、车轮碾压这类交互，那属于另一套机制，见 <a href=\"interaction-bending\">交互弯折</a>。这也是本 hub 的一条清晰边界：周期性的风归解析顶点动画，事件性的交互归运行时贴图。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分层风的数学\">分层风的数学</h2><p>分层风模型（自 Crysis 的植被程序化动画沿用至今，NVIDIA GPU Gems 有经典阐述）把顶点偏移写成几个不同频率正弦的叠加。设某顶点世界位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9084em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、到根部的归一化高度权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w \\in [0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>、全局风方向 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9774em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9774em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0688em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>，主干摆动的水平偏移可写作：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mtext>trunk</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>ω</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta\\vec{p}_{\\text{trunk}} = \\vec{d}\\cdot A_0 \\cdot w^2 \\cdot \\sin\\!\\left(\\omega_0 t + \\phi + k\\,(\\vec{p}\\cdot\\vec{d})\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9084em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vl