><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">leaf</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>叶尖项乘一个叶片边缘遮罩 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>leaf</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{\\text{leaf}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">leaf</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（通常烘进顶点色或 UV），只让叶片边缘颤而枝干不颤。阵风强度再乘一个缓变的噪声包络 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，模拟风一阵强一阵弱。实践里为省 ALU，正弦常用多项式或纹理查表近似，多个层级也常合成一到两个采样。</p>\n<h2 id=\"全局风-风区与工具\">全局风、风区与工具</h2><p>单株的分层摆动之上还有一层全局风参数：风向、基础强度、阵风频率，通常做成场景级的可调变量甚至随时间/天气变化。开放世界还要风区（wind zone）——峡谷里风更强、树林深处风更弱、建筑背风面几乎无风——用一张低分辨率的风场贴图或体积调制每株的风强，让风有地理层次。风的物理来源、风向随天气系统的演化，属于天气 hub 的职责，见 <a href=\"../game-weather-systems/phenomena/wind-simulation\">风的模拟</a>；本 hub 只消费一个「当前风向量 + 风场贴图」，把它翻译成顶点偏移。</p>\n<p>工具侧，SpeedTree 用顶点色、包围盒 Z 轴或权重贴图标出每部分的柔韧度，再喂给统一的风着色器；UE 的 Pivot Painter 把枝条的枢轴和层级烘进纹理，让顶点着色器知道每个顶点该绕哪根枝的哪个支点摆。这些都是把「哪些顶点属于哪一层、绕哪个支点动」这份拓扑信息离线烘进资产，运行时着色器只管按公式摆。要注意远处的风动必须廉价化甚至关闭——impostor 和体素远场根本不逐顶点摆，这条随距离降级的策略归 <a href=\"../practice/vegetation-lod\">植被 LOD</a>。而叶片摆动引起的法线也要随之扰动，才能让受光随风闪烁，那属于 <a href=\"foliage-shading\">植被着色与次表面</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见陷阱\">常见陷阱</h2><p>风动做砸通常砸在四处。其一是整片同步——忘了 per-instance 相位 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span></span></span></span></span> 和空间相位项 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>，整块草像一张布同步抖，一眼假。其二是根部漂移——高度权重没归零，草根跟着摆，看起来像草在地上滑。其三是振幅过大——顶点偏移太夸张，草叶被拉伸变形甚至自交穿插。其四是时序混叠——远处小草的高频颤动小于一像素，逐帧闪烁刺眼，所以远处必须降频降幅乃至停摆（交给 LOD）。把握「分层、相位错开、根部锚定、远处降级」四条，风动才既生动又稳。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>风动是确定性的解析顶点动画，不是物理模拟：顶点偏移只是时间与位置的函数，无状态、可并行、跨机一致，成本低几个数量级。</li>\n<li>风分三层叠加——主干低频大幅、枝条中频、叶尖高频小幅，各由高度权重/叶片遮罩驱动，根部锚定不动。</li>\n<li>空间相位项让相位随位置沿风向递增，整片草呈现「波扫过」的相干；per-instance 相位让每株不同步。</li>\n<li>全局风向量 + 风区贴图提供地理层次；风的物理来源归天气 hub，本 hub 只消费风向量。</li>\n<li>四大陷阱：整片同步、根部漂移、振幅过大、远处高频闪烁——分别用相位、高度权重、限幅、LOD 降级来治。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：运动为何是活力来源见 <a href=\"../foundations/vegetation-components\">植被视觉成分</a>；事件性交互的另一套机制见 <a href=\"interaction-bending\">交互弯折</a>；风相位的实例数据来自 <a href=\"instancing-batching\">实例化与批处理</a>；随风扰动的法线着色见 <a href=\"foliage-shading\">植被着色与次表面</a>；远处停摆的调度见 <a href=\"../practice/vegetation-lod\">植被 LOD</a>。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：风向与强度随天气演化见 <a href=\"../game-weather-systems/phenomena/wind-simulation\">风的模拟</a>；顶点动画之外的次级摆动（骨骼层）思路见 <a href=\"../game-procedural-animation/dynamics/secondary-motion\">次级运动</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"风动动画","id":"风动动画"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：分层的确定性摆动","id":"核心概念-分层的确定性摆动"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么是顶点着色器而不是物理","id":"为什么是顶点着色器而不是物理"},{"level":2,"text":"分层风的数学","id":"分层风的数学"},{"level":2,"text":"全局风、风区与工具","id":"全局风-风区与工具"},{"level":2,"text":"常见陷阱","id":"常见陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"广告牌与 impostor","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-vegetation-rendering/rendering/billboard-impostor"},"next":{"title":"交互弯折","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-vegetation-rendering/animation/interaction-bending"}}